/target

# Generated by `uv` when it resolves this project. There are no Python
# dependencies to lock -- the only package is pyegui itself, built by maturin
# from Cargo.toml -- so the file would be a constant that `uv` rewrites
# identically. Committing it would imply a reproducibility guarantee it
# cannot provide.
uv.lock

